@startuml
title REST Catalog 两段授权与凭证刷新
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  DiamondBorderColor #475569
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
}

start
:查询引擎调用 loadTable\nCatalog 身份 + Delegation Header; <<engine>>
:REST Catalog 校验\n主体能否访问目标表; <<catalog>>
:Catalog 向 STS 申请\n表路径范围内的临时权限; <<catalog>>
:返回 metadata + config\nstorage-credentials\n(prefix, expiry); <<engine>>
:为表创建 FileIO\n按最长 prefix 选择凭证; <<engine>>
:读取 metadata / manifest / data file; <<storage>>

if (临时凭证接近过期？) then (是)
  :调用 table/credentials\n沿用 Catalog 鉴权会话; <<engine>>
  :Catalog 重新校验并签发; <<catalog>>
  :更新各 prefix 的\n存储客户端; <<engine>>
  :继续访问对象存储; <<storage>>
else (否)
  :继续使用当前凭证; <<storage>>
endif

:诊断边界\nCatalog 成功只覆盖第一段授权\n路径未匹配 prefix 时 FileIO 仍会失败; <<catalog>>
stop

skinparam activityBackgroundColor<<engine>> #E0F2FE
skinparam activityBackgroundColor<<catalog>> #FEF3C7
skinparam activityBackgroundColor<<storage>> #DCFCE7
@enduml
